2026-10-09T04:04:30.1834162Z FM_TEST_BEGIN 2026-10-09T04:04:30Z tests/fm-pi-branch-extension.test.sh family=standalone expected_gate_skip=none
2026-10-09T04:04:44.5635926Z ok - asynchronous hold races preserve main fallback and task locks serialize final checks through publication
2026-10-09T04:05:01.4831104Z ok - new holds return accepted signal and stale triggers to main, including mixed queues, and release restores delivery
2026-10-09T04:05:07.6746007Z ok - backlog-only holds route signal and stale rows to main, fail closed on read errors, and release cleanly
2026-10-09T04:05:08.0011250Z ok - fm_branch_outcomes and fm_branch_processed call headers match stock on Pi before and from 0.99
2026-10-09T04:05:09.0282505Z ok - fm_branch_outcomes hides through ToolExecutionComponent while Calm-off and HTML export stay stock
2026-10-09T04:05:09.8841977Z ok - the installed Pi still bounds the picker's list and ranks its search
2026-10-09T04:05:11.8429064Z ok - branch owns accepted wakes with a stable prefix and deterministic verdict-driven delivery
2026-10-09T04:05:11.8595434Z ok - a captain outcome reaches main's model as one typed, sequence-keyed processing request while routine notes stay plain
2026-10-09T04:05:18.2949354Z ok - requested and unsolicited healthy outcomes keep distinct delivery and event ownership
2026-10-09T04:05:20.0547889Z ok - captain outcomes are exact and exactly once across crash, reload, busy main, compaction, and an unrelated assistant response
2026-10-09T04:05:26.3695145Z ok - a captain outcome opens one sequence-keyed processing turn, survives empty and unrelated answers, is re-presented at run end and session start, and closes only on its acknowledgement
2026-10-09T04:05:27.0634380Z ok - Pi: an abbreviated processing request points to the full outcome and instructs main to read it first
2026-10-09T04:05:33.3776058Z ok - Pi: a marker-less >1 MiB backlog is presented oldest first in bounded requests and continues after batch acknowledgement
2026-10-09T04:05:34.5606927Z ok - an unprocessed captain row the store lists without its age is reported to main, never formatted undated, and stays unprocessed until the store is healthy
2026-10-09T04:05:35.0452242Z ok - scopeForUnreadWake excludes every main-only class without vetoing eligible task-local rows, and writes the eligible snapshot
2026-10-09T04:05:35.8634699Z ok - second-mate signal rows route by their new span while crewmate and stale routing stay unchanged
2026-10-09T04:05:37.7173380Z ok - branch prompt_cache_key is stable per home across sessions and distinct between homes
2026-10-09T04:05:40.8102712Z ok - branch default-on eligibility (task-scoped, heartbeat, legacy flag ignored) binds and a broken branch rejects to watcher fallback
2026-10-09T04:05:43.6554267Z ok - under the away-posture record the wake carries the verbatim read-back tail, claims every row, opens no processing turn, cancels a pending request, and presents the accumulated rows after archive
2026-10-09T04:05:48.8525712Z ok - Pi branch: an unchanged held outcome reaches the captain once across cadences, and a later red check on the task still does
2026-10-09T04:05:49.9195500Z ok - an accepted away-only wake rejects after archive, while a drained task-local wake stays a quiet no-op
2026-10-09T04:05:51.1072347Z ok - a claimed heartbeat row on a non-heartbeat away wake lifts task scoping for the fleet report
2026-10-09T04:05:51.6687651Z ok - a heartbeat review survives a check row arriving before its drain
2026-10-09T04:05:53.5567359Z ok - fm_branch_report refuses a task the wake did not name, fleet included, while a heartbeat is unscoped
2026-10-09T04:05:54.3286613Z ok - pre-drain eligibility re-check excludes a newly main-owned row without deferring eligible work
2026-10-09T04:05:55.9963887Z ok - a co-present needs-decision row neither vetoes nor falsely settles routine branch delivery
2026-10-09T04:05:57.6522242Z ok - a settled branch turn without a durable outcome falls back and releases its grant for main replay
2026-10-09T04:06:01.8174394Z ok - provider-error latches cool down, re-probe once with backoff, and recover through a durable report
2026-10-09T04:06:03.5800585Z ok - selection changes preserve in-flight transcript ownership and reset provider-error streaks
2026-10-09T04:06:04.3549282Z ok - a stale main claim returns the durable wake to watcher delivery
2026-10-09T04:06:05.1575468Z ok - pre-drain eligibility re-check no-ops an already-drained wake
